             frame and then jump to the real one. Opening therefore hangs off
             this becoming true rather than off the window opening.

             It is a group of its own, inside the one that is moved: a control
             that is hidden until a condition says otherwise does not play the
             panel out again when the window closes, and the closing animation
             has to stay on a control that is always there. -->
